            </svg>
          </button>
        </h3>
        <div class="details">
          <p>Kneading is a behavior cats carry over from kittenhood, when they knead their mother to stimulate milk flow. Adult cats knead when they feel relaxed, happy, and comfortable, often before settling down to sleep.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

