              <path d="M16.59 8.59L12 13.17 7.41 8.59 6 10l6 6 6-6z" fill="currentColor"/>
            </svg>
          </button>
        </h3>
        <div class="details">
          <p>On average, cats sleep between 12 and 16 hours a day. Some cats, especially kittens and older felines, can sleep up to 20 hours in a 24-hour period. They are crepuscular, meaning they are most active at dawn and dusk.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <p>&copy; 2026 Cat Facts. All rights reserved.</p>
  </footer>

